<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 335 AND 21-0 V AUSTRALIA (370) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 335 AND 21-0 V AUSTRALIA (370) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal, 35 runs behind Australia on</p>
<p>first innings, were 21 without loss in their second innings at</p>
<p>the close on the second day of their four-day cricket match at</p>
<p>Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 335 and 21-0; Australia 370.</p>
</text>
